<title>USA: Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the monthly U.S. Census Bureau oilmill report set for release on Thursday, July 24, at 0800 EDT (1200 GMT).</p>
<p>Note: Estimates for soymeal stocks include meal/cake and soy millfeed stocks covering the month of June 1997.</p>
<p>				  Range	   Average   Prev. Month</p>
<p> Soybean crushings-X   108,000-109,000  108,500   110,712</p>
<p> Soymeal stocks-Y	255,000-298,000  270,000   256,527</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>SOYOIL FACTORY AND WAREHOUSE STOCKS:</p>
<p>    Total-Z		  2,125-2,150	2,136    2,143</p>
<p>(X=1,000 Bu, Y=Short Tons, Z=Mln Lbs)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
